OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and dull day, though
OL,6,Fthere may be an occasional bright
OL,7,Fbreaks, particularly in the north and
OL,8,Fwest. Light rain along the south coast
OL,9,Fat first, but dry otherwise. Feeling
OL,10,Fcool, with temperatures near the
OL,11,Fseasonal average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining cloudy and dry
OL,14,Fthrough the evening. Light rain later,
OL,15,Fduring the night, for some in the
OL,16,Fsouth. Feeling chilly, especially for
OL,17,Fsheltered rural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
