OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FAnother cloudy day, with fewer
OL,6,Fbright breaks than on Thursday. Spots
OL,7,Fof patchy rain at times, though this
OL,8,Fwill mainly be focused around the
OL,9,Fsouth and west. Feeling cool.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCool
OL,12,Fand cloudy conditions persisting
OL,13,Fthrough Saturday, with showers for
OL,14,Fsome. Fog and frost then pleasant
OL,15,Fautumnal sunshine on Sunday. Cloud
OL,16,Fthickening through Monday as rain
OL,17,Fapproaches.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
